  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-hotplug-engine",
      "text": "[English](./README.en.md)\n\n给 DSH 做插件管理的服务插件。市场、agent、其他插件都能调用：安装、卸载、启停、回滚、审计，一条链路。"
    },
    {
      "section": "做什么",
      "text": "DSH 用 `cordis.patch.yml` 和 loader 管理插件。这个插件把这套操作包成服务：改 patch、调 pnpm、装后健康确认、失败自动回滚、全程审计。只动文件和命令，不碰内核。"
    },
    {
      "section": "不做什么",
      "text": "- **不是市场**：没有目录、搜索、榜单、推荐。`spec`（装什么、从哪装）由调用方给，引擎不猜。\n- **不改官方机制**：HMR、loader、patch 语义都是官方的，只消费，不重写。\n- **不另存状态**：以官方组合树为唯一真源，引擎只投影和差分。\n- **不带安装界面**：UI 只有最小管理面板（查看、启停、回滚、审计），没有 spec 输入。"
    },
    {
      "section": "接入方式",
      "text": "| 场景 | 入口 |\n|---|---|\n| 市场 / 插件管理界面 | 注入 `hotplugEngine` 服务，或调 REST |\n| agent 会话 | `hotplug_*` 工具 |\n| 宿主插件 | 注入 `hotplugEngine` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm --dir <profile-dir> add dsh-hotplug-engine"
    },
    {
      "section": "或 dsh plugin add dsh-hotplug-engine",
      "text": "```\n\nbundle 包：装/卸后重启 profile；新客户端面板刷新页面加载。"
    },
    {
      "section": "启停",
      "text": "- 引擎改 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml`，loader 反射后即时生效（`mode:'hot'`）；未反射则提示重启。\n- patch 行（用户写的或引擎写的）都能启停，流式/块式 YAML 都能改。\n- DSH 默认禁用的行（在 bundle 层，没有引擎可改的 patch 行）改不了：UI 显示 🔒「默认禁用」，点击只浮提示，API 返回 `HOTPLUG.PATCH.DEFAULT_DISABLED`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH 版本",
      "text": "- 目标 `0.1.1-rc.2`（current），带版本支持矩阵（`supportReport()`）。\n- `dshPath` 显式配置才走官方 `dsh plugin` CLI，否则 pnpm 直装。\n- `0.1.0-rc.6` 为 legacy，不再作为验收目标。"
    },
    {
      "section": "上手",
      "text": "- **宿主注入**：`inject: ['hotplugEngine']`，调 `ctx.hotplugEngine` 的 `install` / `rollback` / `enable` 等方法，Promise resolve 即操作完成。\n- **REST**：前缀 `/api/dsh-hotplug`，同源。写：`install` / `uninstall` / `enable` / `disable` / `rollback`；读：`snapshot` / `status` / `audit` / `operations` / `events`（SSE）。\n- **工具**：`hotplug_status` / `hotplug_install` / `hotplug_uninstall` / `hotplug_toggle` / `hotplug_rollback` / `hotplug_audit`，写工具走审批。\n\n完整契约见 [docs/01-contract.md](docs/01-contract.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-hotplug-engine",
      "text": "[中文](./README.md)\n\nA service plugin for managing DSH plugins. Marketplaces, agents, and other plugins can call it for the full chain: install, uninstall, enable, disable, rollback, audit."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "DSH manages plugins through `cordis.patch.yml` and the loader. This plugin wraps those operations into a service: edit the patch, run pnpm, confirm health after install, roll back on failure, audit everything. It only touches files and commands, never the core."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it doesn't do",
      "text": "- **Not a marketplace**: no catalog, search, rankings, or curation. The caller supplies `spec` (what to install, from where); the engine doesn't guess.\n- **Doesn't rewrite official mechanisms**: HMR, loader, and patch semantics are official; the engine only consumes them.\n- **Holds no state of its own**: the official config tree is the single source of truth; the engine only projects and diffs.\n- **No install UI**: the UI is a minimal management panel (view, toggle, roll back, audit) — no spec input."
    },
    {
      "section": "Entry points",
      "text": "| Scenario | Entry |\n|---|---|\n| Marketplace / plugin-manager UI | inject `hotplugEngine`, or call REST |\n| Agent sessions | `hotplug_*` tools |\n| Host plugins | inject `hotplugEngine` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm --dir <profile-dir> add dsh-hotplug-engine"
    },
    {
      "section": "or dsh plugin add dsh-hotplug-engine",
      "text": "```\n\nBundle package: restart the profile after install/uninstall; refresh the page for a new client panel."
    },
    {
      "section": "Enable / disable",
      "text": "- The engine edits the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`; once the loader reflects it, it takes effect (`mode:'hot'`). If not reflected, a restart is suggested.\n- Patch rows — user-written or engine-written — can be toggled, in flow or block YAML.\n- Rows default-disabled by DSH (in the bundle layer, with no engine-editable patch row) can't be modified: the UI shows 🔒 \"default-disabled\" and only flashes a hint on click; the API returns `HOTPLUG.PATCH.DEFAULT_DISABLED`."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH versions",
      "text": "- Target `0.1.1-rc.2` (current), with a version support matrix (`supportReport()`).\n- `dshPath` must be set explicitly to use the official `dsh plugin` CLI; otherwise pnpm.\n- `0.1.0-rc.6` is legacy, no longer an acceptance target."
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "- **Host inject**: `inject: ['hotplugEngine']`, then call `install` / `rollback` / `enable` on `ctx.hotplugEngine`. The promise resolves when the operation is done.\n- **REST**: prefix `/api/dsh-hotplug`, same-origin. Writes: `install` / `uninstall` / `enable` / `disable` / `rollback`. Reads: `snapshot` / `status` / `audit` / `operations` / `events` (SSE).\n- **Tools**: `hotplug_status` / `hotplug_install` / `hotplug_uninstall` / `hotplug_toggle` / `hotplug_rollback` / `hotplug_audit`; write tools go through approval."
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "Full contract: [docs/01-contract.md](docs/01-contract.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
